=== Text #3 ===
> [On Monday], May[ 8], 2017, the construction of the new[ Amethyst] Radiotherapy Center in Austria has begun. According to the estimations the treatment of the first patients will be possible in the end of 2017.
Since the Centre Charlebourg-La Defense joined in 2015[ Amethyst] Radiotherapy group, it had benefited from a major investment plan: 2 additional bunkers are build and a new accelerator will be installed current 2017 year.
Patients from Ma[ł]opolska have now access to stereotactic therapy in[ Am]ethyst’s Krakow center.
As of June 2015, Amethyst Radiotherapy finalized the acquisition of another clinic in France, reaching a network of three clinics in this country and six in total, across Europe.
